 | C:0&rarr;C,1&rarr;C | D:0&rarr;E,1&rarr;B | E:0&rarr;F,1&rarr;A | F:0&rarr;F,1&rarr;F</div><div class=\"qmeta\"><span class=\"mb2\">4 Marks</span><span class=\"cb2\">CO2</span></div></div>\n          <div class=\"qbody\" style=\"display:none\"><button class=\"tbtn\" onclick=\"toggleAns(this)\">Show Answer</button>\n            <div class=\"qans\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"qans-lbl\">Answer</div>\n              Check (C,F): C:0&rarr;C(acc), F:0&rarr;F(acc); C:1&rarr;C(acc), F:1&rarr;F(acc) &rarr; <strong>C &equiv; F</strong><br>\n              All other non-accepting states are distinct (verify by checking transitions lead to differently-distinguished states).<br>\n              <strong>5-state minimized DFA:</strong>\n              <div class=\"tw mt8\"><table><thead><tr><th>State</th><th>0</th><th>1</th><th>Accept?</th></tr></thead>\n              <tbody>\n                <tr><td><span class=\"strt\">&rarr; A</span></td><td>B</td><td>D</td><td></td></tr>\n                <tr><td>B</td><td>CF</td><td>E</td><td></td></tr>\n                <tr><td>D</td><td>E</td><td>B</td><td></td></tr>\n                <tr><td>E</td><td>CF</td><td>A</td><td></td></tr>\n                <tr><td>CF</td><td>CF</td><td>CF</td><td class=\"acc\">Y</td></tr>\n              </tbody></table></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"qcard\">\n          <div class=\"qhdr\" onclick=\"toggleQ(this)\"><div class=\"qnum\">6</div><div class=\"qtxt\">Prove: Regular languages are closed under (a) Complement and (b) Intersection. Provide formal proof and example for each.</div><div class=\"qmeta\"><span class=\"mb2\">4 Marks</span><span class=\"cb2\">CO2</span></div></div>\n          <div class=\"qbody\" style=\"display:none\"><button class=\"tbtn\" onclick=\"toggleAns(this)\">Show Answer</button>\n            <div class=\"qans\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"qans-lbl\">Answer</div>\n              <strong>(a) Complement:</strong> Let L = L(M) for DFA M=(Q,&Sigma;,&delta;,q0,F). Build M'=(Q,&Sigma;,&delta;,q0,Q-F). L(M') = &Sigma;*-L = L-bar. Regular. &checkmark;<br>\n              Ex: L={even-length} &rarr; L-bar={odd-length}. Both regular.<br><br>\n              <strong>(b) Intersection (Cross-product):</strong> M=(Q1&times;Q2, &Sigma;, &delta;, (q01,q02), F1&times;F2) where &delta;((p,q),a)=(&delta;1(p,a),&delta;2(q,a)). L(M) = L1&cap;L2. Regular. &checkmark;<br>\n              Alternatively: L1&cap;L2 = complement(L1-bar &cup; L2-bar) &mdash; closed under complement &amp; union.\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- PAPER 4 -->\n      <div class=\"pc\" id=\"p3\">\n        <div class=\"alert info\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px\"><div class=\"ai\">&#128203;</div><div><strong>Paper 4 &mdash; Comprehensive / Hardest</strong> | 14 Marks</div></div>\n\n        <div class=\"qcard\">\n          <div class=\"qhdr\" onclick=\"toggleQ(this)\"><div class=\"qnum\">1a</div><div class=\"qtxt\">What is a Regular Language? Give 2 examples and 2 non-examples with justification.</div><div class=\"qmeta\"><span class=\"mb2\">1 Mark</span><span class=\"cb2\">CO1</span></div></div>\n          <div class=\"qbody\" style=\"display:none\"><button class=\"tbtn\" onclick=\"toggleAns(this)\">Show Answer</button>\n            <div class=\"qans\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"qans-lbl\">Answer</div>\n              A regular language is recognized by a Finite Automaton (equiv: described by RE).<br>\n              <strong>Examples:</strong> {w | w contains &quot;00&quot;}; {w | |w| is even}<br>\n              <strong>Non-examples:</strong> {a^n b^n | n&ge;0} (needs counting); {ww | w &isin; {a,b}*} (needs memory beyond FA)\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"qcard\">\n          <div class=\"qhdr\" onclick=\"toggleQ(this)\"><div class=\"qnum\">1b</div><div class=\"qtxt\">For string w=&quot;baabb&quot;, find its reversal and list all substrings of length exactly 2.</div><div class=\"qmeta\"><span class=\"mb2\">1 Mark</span><span class=\"cb2\">CO1</span></div></div>\n          <div class=\"qbody\" style=\"display:none\"><button class=\"tbtn\" onclick=\"toggleAns(this)\">Show Answer</button>\n            <div class=\"qans\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"qans-lbl\">Answer</div>\n              <strong>Reversal:</strong> w^R = &quot;bbaab&quot;<br>\n              <strong>Substrings of length 2:</strong> ba, aa, ab, bb (unique set: {ba, aa, ab, bb})\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"qcard\">\n          <div class=\"qhdr\" onclick=\"toggleQ(this)\"><div class=\"qnum\">2</div><div class=\"qtxt\">Write RE and give DFA for: L = all strings over {a,b} that do NOT contain &quot;bb&quot;.</div><div class=\"qmeta\"><span class=\"mb2\">2 Marks</span><span class=\"cb2\">CO1</span></div></div>\n          <div class=\"qbody\" style=\"display:none\"><button class=\"tbtn\" onclick=\"toggleAns(this)\">Show Answer</button>\n            <div class=\"qans\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"qans-lbl\">Answer</div>\n              <strong>RE:</strong> <code>(a + ba)*(e + b)</code> (e = &epsilon;)<br>\n              <div class=\"tw mt8\"><table><thead><tr><th>State</th><th>a</th><th>b</th><th>Accept?</th></tr></thead>\n              <tbody>\n                <tr><td><span class=\"strt\">&rarr; q0</span></td><td>q0</td><td>q1</td><td class=\"acc\">Y</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>q1 (last=b)</td><td>q0</td><td>q2</td><td class=\"acc\">Y</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>q2 (saw &quot;bb&quot;)</td><td>q2</td><td>q2</td><td class=\"rej\">N</td></tr>\n              </tbody></table></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"qcard\">\n          <div class=\"qhdr\" onclick=\"toggleQ(this)\"><div class=\"qnum\">3</div><div class=\"qtxt\">Construct DFA over &Sigma;={0,1} accepting all strings containing &quot;010&quot; as a substring. RE: (0+1)*010(0+1)*</div><div class=\"qmeta\"><span class=\"mb2\">2 Marks</span><span class=\"cb2\">CO2</span></div></div>\n          <div class=\"qbody\" style=\"display:none\"><button class=\"tbtn\" onclick=\"toggleAns(this)\">Show Answer</button>\n            <div class=\"qans\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"qans-lbl\">Answer &mdash; 4 States</div>\n              <div class=\"tw\"><table><thead><tr><th>State</th><th>Meaning</th><th>0</th><th>1</th><th>Accept?</th></tr></thead>\n              <tbody>\n                <tr><td><span class=\"strt\">&rarr; q0</span></td><td>Start</td><td>q1</td><td>q0</td><td></td></tr>\n                <tr><td>q1</td><td>Saw &quot;0&quot;</td><td>q1</td><td>q2</td><td></td></tr>\n                <tr><td>q2</td><td>Saw &quot;01&quot;</td><td>q3</td><td>q0</td><td></td></tr>\n                <tr><td>q3</td><td>Saw &quot;010&quot;</td><td>q3</td><td>q3</td><td class=\"acc\">Y</td></tr>\n              </tbody></table></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"qcard\">\n          <div class=\"qhdr\" onclick=\"toggleQ(this)\"><div class=\"qnum\">4</div><div class=\"qtxt\">Convert &epsilon;-NFA to DFA then minimize: {q0,q1,q2}, Start=q0, Accept={q2}. q0&rarr;&epsilon;&rarr;q1. q0:a&rarr;q0. q1:a&rarr;q2. q2:a,b&rarr;q2. &Sigma;={a,b}.</div><div class=\"qmeta\"><span class=\"mb2\">2 Marks</span><span class=\"cb2\">CO2</span></div></div>\n          <div class=\"qbody\" style=\"display:none\"><button class=\"tbtn\" onclick=\"toggleAns(this)\">Show Answer</button>\n            <div class=\"qans\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"qans-lbl\">Answer</div>\n              &epsilon;-cl(q0)={q0,q1}. DFA Start A={q0,q1}.<br>\n              A:a&rarr;&epsilon;-cl({q0,q2})={q0,q1,q2}=B; A:b&rarr;&empty;<br>\n              B:a&rarr;B; B:b&rarr;&epsilon;-cl({q2})={q2}=C<br>\n              <div class=\"tw mt8\"><table><thead><tr><th>DFA</th><th>a</th><th>b</th><th>Accept?</th></tr></thead>\n              <tbody>\n                <tr><td><span class=\"strt\">A={q0,q1}</span></td><td>B</td><td>&empty;</td><td></td></tr>\n                <tr><td>B={q0,q1,q2}</td><td>B</td><td>C</td><td class=\"acc\">Y</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>C={q2}</td><td>C</td><td>C</td><td class=\"acc\">Y</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>&empty;</td><td>&empty;</td><td>&empty;</td><td></td></tr>\n              </tbody></table></div>\n              <strong>Minimization:</strong> (B,C): B:a&rarr;B,C:a&rarr;C (both acc); B:b&rarr;C,C:b&rarr;C &rarr; <strong>B &equiv; C</strong>. Minimized to 3 states: A, BC, &empty;.<br>\n              Language: strings with at least one 'a'. RE: (a+b)*a(a+b)*\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"qcard\">\n          <div class=\"qhdr\" onclick=\"toggleQ(this)\"><div class=\"qnum\">5</div><div class=\"qtxt\">Design Moore Machine over &Sigma;={0,1}: output = remainder when binary string read so far is divided by 3. Convert to Mealy Machine.</div><div class=\"qmeta\"><span class=\"mb2\">4 Marks</span><span class=\"cb2\">CO2</span></div></div>\n          <div class=\"qbody\" style=\"display:none\"><button class=\"tbtn\" onclick=\"toggleAns(this)\">Show Answer</button>\n            <div class=\"qans\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"qans-lbl\">Answer &mdash; Moore (3 States, new_val = (2&times;old+bit) mod 3)</div>\n              <div class=\"tw\"><table><thead><tr><th>State (rem)</th><th>Output</th><th>On 0</th><th>On 1</th></tr></thead>\n              <tbody>\n                <tr><td><span class=\"strt\">&rarr; q0</span></td><td>0</td><td>q0</td><td>q1</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>q1</td><td>1</td><td>q2</td><td>q0</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>q2</td><td>2</td><td>q1</td><td>q2</td></tr>\n              </tbody></table></div>\n              <em style=\"font-size:13px\">Check: &quot;110&quot;(=6): q0&rarr;q1&rarr;q0&rarr;q0. Output at q0=0. 6 mod 3=0 &#10003;</em><br><br>\n              <strong>Mealy (output = &lambda; of destination):</strong>\n              <div class=\"tw mt8\"><table><thead><tr><th>State</th><th>Input</th><th>Output</th><th>Next</th></tr></thead>\n              <tbody>\n                <tr><td><span class=\"strt\">&rarr; q0</span></td><td>0</td><td class=\"tg\">0</td><td>q0</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>q0</td><td>1</td><td>1</td><td>q1</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>q1</td><td>0</td><td class=\"ta\">2</td><td>q2</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>q1</td><td>1</td><td class=\"tg\">0</td><td>q0</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>q2</td><td>0</td><td>1</td><td>q1</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>q2</td><td>1</td><td class=\"ta\">2</td><td>q2</td></tr>\n              </tbody></table></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"qcard\">\n          <div class=\"qhdr\" onclick=\"toggleQ(this)\"><div class=\"qnum\">6</div><div class=\"qtxt\">Minimize DFA (&Sigma;={a,b}): {q0,q1,q2,q3,q4}, Start=q0, Accept={q1,q3}. q0:a&rarr;q1,b&rarr;q3 | q1:a&rarr;q2,b&rarr;q1 | q2:a&rarr;q2,b&rarr;q4 | q3:a&rarr;q3,b&rarr;q2 | q4:a&rarr;q4,b&rarr;q4</div><div class=\"qmeta\"><span class=\"mb2\">4 Marks</span><span class=\"cb2\">CO2</span></div></div>\n          <div class=\"qbody\" style=\"display:none\"><button class=\"tbtn\" onclick=\"toggleAns(this)\">Show Answer</button>\n            <div class=\"qans\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"qans-lbl\">Answer</div>\n              <strong>Base mark:</strong> (q0,q1),(q0,q3),(q2,q1),(q2,q3),(q4,q1),(q4,q3)<br>\n              <strong>Check (q1,q3):</strong> q1:a&rarr;q2, q3:a&rarr;q3 &rarr; (q2,q3) marked &rarr; mark (q1,q3)<br>\n              <strong>Check (q0,q2):</strong> q0:a&rarr;q1(acc), q2:a&rarr;q2(non-acc) &rarr; (q1,q2) marked &rarr; mark (q0,q2)<br>\n              <strong>Check (q0,q4):</strong> q0:a&rarr;q1(acc), q4:a&rarr;q4(non-acc) &rarr; marked<br>\n              <strong>Check (q2,q4):</strong> q2:a&rarr;q2, q4:a&rarr;q4 &rarr; (q2,q4) status? q2:b&rarr;q4, q4:b&rarr;q4 &rarr; (q4,q4) = same &rarr; not marked. q2:a&rarr;q2, q4:a&rarr;q4 &rarr; (q2,q4) &rarr; checking... no direct distinguish &rarr; <strong>q2 &equiv; q4</strong><br>\n              Minimized 4-state DFA:\n              <div class=\"tw mt8\"><table><thead><tr><th>State</th><th>a</th><th>b</th><th>Accept?</th></tr></thead>\n              <tbody>\n                <tr><td><span class=\"strt\">&rarr; q0</span></td><td>q1</td><td>q3</td><td></td></tr>\n                <tr><td>q1</td><td>q24</td><td>q1</td><td class=\"acc\">Y</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>q3</td><td>q3</td><td>q24</td><td class=\"acc\">Y</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>q24</td><td>q24</td><td>q24</td><td></td></tr>\n              </tbody></table></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div><!-- end papers -->\n\n  </div><!-- content -->\n</div><!-- main -->\n\n<script>\nfunction setActive(el){\n  document.querySelectorAll('.nav-item').forEach(function(i){i.classList.remove('active');});\n  el.classList.add('active');\n}\n\nfunction showPaper(i){\n  document.querySelectorAll('.pc').forEach(function(p,j){p.classList.toggle('show',j===i);});\n  document.querySelectorAll('.ptab').forEach(function(t,j){t.classList.toggle('at',j===i);});\n}\n\nfunction toggleQ(hdr){\n  var b=hdr.nextElementSibling;\n  if(b) b.style.display=(b.style.display==='none'||!b.style.display)?'block':'none';\n}\n\nfunction toggleAns(btn){\n  var a=btn.nextElementSibling;\n  if(!a) return;\n  var v=a.style.display==='block';\n  a.style.display=v?'none':'block';\n  btn.textContent=v?'Show Answer':'Hide Answer';\n}\n\nvar secs=document.querySelectorAll('.section[id]');\nvar navs=document.querySelectorAll('.nav-item[href]');\nvar obs=new IntersectionObserver(function(entries){\n  entries.forEach(function(e){\n    if(e.isIntersecting){\n      var id='#'+e.target.id;\n      navs.forEach(function(n){n.classList.toggle('active',n.getAttribute('href')===id);});\n    }\n  });\n},{threshold:0.15,rootMargin:'-70px 0px -65% 0px'});\nsecs.forEach(function(s){obs.observe(s);});\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","Description":"Dark-themed TOC study website. All HTML entities used instead of special characters to avoid encoding issues.","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\tanus\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\a2d53718-58c1-49c0-9cb0-9ac51d4c37cc\\TOC-Study-Hub\\index.html","toolAction":"Writing TOC website HTML file","toolSummary":"TOC study hub HTML artifact"}}]}
